# lead-matching-service/ + rf-lead-matching-service/ + dashboard/ at the
# repo root (2026-09-17 audit, docs/ARCHITECTURE_AUDIT_2026-09-17.md;
# confirmed dead 2026-09-30: every env var in its .env belongs to the
# retired pilot-v1 n8n/Sheets workflow, nothing live reads it). Was already
# untracked (0 files in git ls-files) -- this just makes that permanent.
nika-matching-pilot-starter/

# Empty leftover from the lead-matching-service -> dubai-lead-matching-service
# rename (2026-10-05, Dubai rename): git mv failed with "Device or resource
# busy" (a file handle held by a running process/IDE watcher), so contents
# were copied to the new path and this old directory's files were removed
# individually -- the empty top-level directory itself could not be rmdir'd
# for the same reason. Harmless; safe to delete by hand once nothing holds
# it open.
lead-matching-service/

